</div></button><div class=\"mat-tab-label-container\"><div role=\"tablist\" class=\"mat-tab-list\"><div class=\"mat-tab-labels\"><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator mat-tab-label-active ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-0\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-posinset=\"1\" aria-setsize=\"3\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">Overview<!----><!----><!----></div></div><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-1\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"2\" aria-setsize=\"3\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">Payment Options<!----><!----><!----></div></div><div role=\"tab\" mattablabelwrapper=\"\" mat-ripple=\"\" cdkmonitorelementfocus=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-label mat-focus-indicator ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-label-0-2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-posinset=\"3\" aria-setsize=\"3\" aria-controls=\"mat-tab-content-0-2\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><div class=\"mat-tab-label-content\">Mobile Services<!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----></div><mat-ink-bar class=\"mat-ink-bar\"></mat-ink-bar></div></div><button aria-hidden=\"false\" type=\"button\" mat-ripple=\"\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-tab-header-pagination mat-tab-header-pagination-after mat-elevation-z4 mat-tab-header-pagination-disabled\" disabled=\"\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next slide\"><div class=\"mat-tab-header-pagination-chevron\"></div></button></mat-tab-header><div class=\"mat-tab-body-wrapper\"><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-19 mat-tab-body-active ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-0\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-19 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----><div class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><section class=\"reservation-services\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h2>Reservation Services</h2>\n<p><strong>Reservations on any Saudia flights may be made by:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Booking online through the Saudia website.</li>\n    <li>Contacting Saudia reservation offices.</li>\n    <li>Visiting one of our City Ticket Offices (CTO).</li>\n    <li>Contacting your travel agency.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Reservations can be made by passengers themselves, their offices, or travel agencies via telephone calls. To ensure faster service, please have the following information ready when calling:</p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Destination</li>\n    <li>Date of travel</li>\n    <li>Class of travel</li>\n    <li>Number of accompanying passengers</li>\n    <li>Names and nationalities of your companions (as shown in their passports)</li>\n    <li>Your contact telephone number</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"highlight\">\n<p>During the call, the agent will provide a time limit for ticket purchase. Please note it to avoid automatic cancellation.</p>\n</div>\n<p>If you have onward or return reservations, contact any Saudia office to add your telephone number to your booking record. This allows us to inform you of any schedule changes.</p>\n<p>You will also receive a booking reference number. Please write it down and present it when purchasing your ticket(s) or checking in at the airport.</p>\n<div class=\"contact\">\n<h3>Contact Information</h3>\n<p>For immediate assistance, our reservation agents are available 24/7.</p>\n<p><strong>Call Center (within KSA – Jeddah, Riyadh, Dhahran):</strong> 9200 22222</p>\n<p><a href=\"/en-SA/Support/HelpAndSupport/WorldWideOffices\">Find the nearest office to your location</a><strong>Government Reservations (after-sales services):</strong> <a href=\"/en-SA/book/flight-information/reservation-services/Page-Components/tabs/Overview\">Click here</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section></span><!----></p><!----></div><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-20 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-1\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-20 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-21 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-2\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-21 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><!----></div></mat-tab-group><!----></div></app-jss-tabs><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}